  "text_pages": [
    "Exchange/Visiting Pre-Arrival Guide - International House A/C/E\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nInternational House A/C/E\nInternational House A/C/E\nSeoul Campus\nInternational House Rates\nRegular Semester (16 weeks)\nA: 1,740,000 KRW\nC: 1,760,000 ~ 2,160,000 KRW\nE: 1,960,000 ~ 2,160,000 KRW\nVacation (8 weeks)\nA:\n870,000\nKRW\nC:\n880,000 ~ 1,080,000\nKRW\nE:\n980,000\n~\n1,080,000\nKRW\n※ Dormitory Fee could be changed with prior notice.\nAddresses\nInternational House A\n4-10, Huigyeong-ro, Dongdaemun-gu, Seoul, Korea\nInternational House\nC\n11-5, Imun-ro 9ga-gil, Dongdaemun-gu, Seoul, Korea\nInternational House E\n346-76 Imun 1(il)-dong, Dongdaemun-gu, Seoul\nLocation\nHouse A (Women Only)\nInternational House E (Co-Ed Building)\nLocation\nHouse\nC\nInternational House\nA\nInternational House\nC\nInternational House E\nNotes\nHouse C is offered to students who applied for either Houses A or E, but the capacity is full.\nAmenities\nThe International Houses are the HUFS off-campus dormitories operated by our office.  All of the International Houses are located a short walking distance from campus.\nAir-conditioned\nEquipped with cooking facilities\nFree internet access (LAN/WiFi)\nSeparate toilet/bathroom\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nReport abuse"
  ],
